# Line endings.
#
# The repo had exactly one CRLF file — the events CSV, which is the declared
# source of record for src/data/events-2026.ts. Editing it from a script that
# normalises newlines rewrote all 62 lines and buried a one-field change in a
# 124-line diff. Normalising to LF everywhere makes that class of noise
# impossible rather than something each editor has to remember.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never line-ending-converted, never diffed as text.
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
